    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d478">

                <pb facs="0500" n="328" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg328"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.20235/84</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-20T12:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 20, 1917, 12 noon</hi></date>. <lb/>
                            [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 2 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Minister for Foreign Affairs in Senate interpellation last night confined himself
                    to reading correspondence with Imperial German Government. Thereupon the Senate,
                    23 to 1, voted its opinion that the Argentine Government should break relations
                    with Germany.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
